sequenceDiagram
    actor Operator
    participant UI as Operator workspace (Unit 8)
    participant F as Fulfillment Simulator
    participant FDB as Fulfillment database
    participant O as Orders API
    participant ODB as Orders database
    participant C as Customer
    Operator->>UI: Advance expected revision with operation ID and reason
    UI->>F: Authenticated transition request
    F->>FDB: Lock shipment, verify revision and allowed state
    FDB->>FDB: Update state/revision and append transition audit
    F-->>UI: Original or newly committed receipt
    O->>F: Read simulator-owned tracking state
    O->>ODB: Persist owner-scoped mirror and versioned event (Unit 8)
    C->>O: Read own order tracking
    O->>O: Verify subject owns order
    O->>F: Read narrow shipment status with service credential
    O-->>C: Tracking state, deterministic ETA, unavailable flag if needed
